sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant D as Dashboard
    participant E0 as edge strava-config
    participant SA as Strava OAuth
    participant CB as StravaCallback page
    participant E1 as edge strava-connect
    participant E2 as edge strava-sync-manual
    participant E3 as edge strava-webhook
    participant DB as Postgres

    U->>D: Connect Strava
    D->>E0: GET client_id
    E0-->>D: client_id
    D->>SA: redirect authorize
    SA-->>CB: redirect with code
    CB->>E1: POST code
    E1->>SA: exchange code for tokens
    SA-->>E1: access_token, refresh_token, expires_at, athlete
    E1->>DB: upsert strava_tokens (service role)
    Note over D,E2: Manual sync path
    U->>D: Sync Strava
    D->>E2: POST (JWT)
    E2->>DB: SELECT strava_tokens WHERE user_id
    E2->>E2: ensureFreshToken (refresh if expires within 60s)
    E2->>SA: GET /api/v3/athlete/activities
    SA-->>E2: activities
    loop per matching active registration
        E2->>DB: INSERT activity_logs (idempotent by strava_activity_id)
    end
    Note over E3,DB: Webhook path - signature/verify_token check needs verification
    SA-->>E3: POST activity event
    E3->>DB: ingest similar to manual sync
